<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Beyond Higher Rank: Token-wise Input-Output Projections for Efficient Low-Rank Adaptation</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Shiwei Li
Xiandi Luo
Haozhao Wang
Xing Tang
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
